{"seq":2,"slug":"constraint-files","title":"约束文件编写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-development-flow/constraint-files","wordCount":1430,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"约束文件编写\">约束文件编写</h1><p>约束文件是 FPGA 设计中连接逻辑世界与物理世界的桥梁。它告诉工具链时钟的频率是多少、信号应该分配到哪个引脚、信号之间的时序关系如何。没有正确的约束，即使 RTL 代码完美无误，综合实现后的硬件也可能无法正常工作。本文以 Xilinx/AMD 的 XDC 格式和通用的 SDC 格式为主，详解约束文件的编写方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>约束文件是设计意图进入工具链的唯一通道：工具无法从 RTL 中推断出目标时钟频率、引脚位置和电气标准，这些信息必须显式声明，否则实现结果只是一份&quot;能跑但不可控&quot;的电路。约束因此不是可选项，而是把逻辑世界与物理世界对齐的契约。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时序约束</strong>定义&quot;要跑多快&quot;：时钟、输入输出延迟、时序例外，决定工具如何优化关键路径。</li>\n<li><strong>物理约束</strong>定义&quot;接在哪里&quot;：引脚分配、电气标准、Bank 电压，决定信号能否正确地进出器件。</li>\n<li><strong>约束分层与顺序</strong>：XDC 按读入顺序和行号确定优先级，后读入覆盖先读入、具体覆盖通用，因此文件组织本身影响结果。</li>\n<li><strong>完备但不过度</strong>是理想约束的标准：约束不足会让隐患逃过分析，约束过度会剥夺工具的优化空间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"约束文件的作用与分类\">约束文件的作用与分类</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 约束类型&#10;        TC[&quot;时序约束&lt;br/&gt;Timing Constraints&quot;] --&gt; TOOL[&quot;综合/实现工具&quot;]&#10;        PC[&quot;物理约束&lt;br/&gt;Physical Constraints&quot;] --&gt; TOOL&#10;        CC[&quot;配置约束&lt;br/&gt;Configuration&quot;] --&gt; TOOL&#10;    end&#10;    TOOL --&gt; RESULT[&quot;正确的时序行为&lt;br/&gt;+&lt;br/&gt;正确的引脚映射&quot;]\">graph LR\n    subgraph 约束类型\n        TC[\"时序约束&lt;br/&gt;Timing Constraints\"] --&gt; TOOL[\"综合/实现工具\"]\n        PC[\"物理约束&lt;br/&gt;Physical Constraints\"] --&gt; TOOL\n        CC[\"配置约束&lt;br/&gt;Configuration\"] --&gt; TOOL\n    end\n    TOOL --&gt; RESULT[\"正确的时序行为&lt;br/&gt;+&lt;br/&gt;正确的引脚映射\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束类型</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>影响阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时序约束</td>\n<td>时钟定义、输入/输出延迟、多周期路径、伪路径</td>\n<td>综合 + 实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理约束</td>\n<td>引脚分配（LOC）、电气标准（IOSTANDARD）、Bank 电压</td>\n<td>布局布线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置约束</td>\n<td>配置速率、电压、启动时钟选择</td>\n<td>比特流生成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时序约束\">时序约束</h2><h3 id=\"时钟定义-create_clock\">时钟定义（create_clock）</h3><p>时钟约束是所有时序分析的基础。未定义时钟的设计无法进行有效的时序分析：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tcl\" data-code=\"# 定义主时钟：100 MHz，周期 10 ns&#10;create_clock -period 10.000 -name sys_clk [get_ports clk_100m]&#10;&#10;# 定义差分时钟输入&#10;create_clock -period 5.000 -name ddr_clk [get_ports clk_200m_p]&#10;&#10;# 虚拟时钟（无物理端口，用于约束 IO 延迟参考）&#10;create_clock -period 8.000 -name virt_clk\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 定义主时钟：100 MHz，周期 10 ns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>create_clock -period 10.000 -name sys_clk [get_ports clk_100m]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 定义差分时钟输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>create_clock -period 5.000 -name ddr_clk [get_ports clk_200m_p]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 虚拟时钟（无物理端口，用于约束 IO 延迟参考）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>create_clock -period 8.000 -name virt_clk</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"生成时钟-create_generated_clock\">生成时钟（create_generated_clock）</h3><p>对于 PLL/MMCM 输出的时钟，工具通常自动识别。对于分频器或门控时钟等特殊情况需要手动定义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tcl\" data-code=\"# MMCM 输出（通常自动推断，无需手动定义）&#10;# 手动定义分频时钟&#10;create_generated_clock -name clk_div2 \\&#10;    -source [get_pins mmcm_inst/CLKOUT0] \\&#10;    -divide_by 2 \\&#10;    [get_pins divider_reg/Q]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># MMCM 输出（通常自动推断，无需手动定义）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 手动定义分频时钟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>create_generated_clock -name clk_div2 \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -source [get_pins mmcm_inst/CLKOUT0] \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -divide_by 2 \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [get_pins divider_reg/Q]</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"输入-输出延迟\">输入/输出延迟</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>set_input_delay</code></td>\n<td>数据到达 FPGA 引脚相对于时钟边沿的延迟</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{co} + T_{board}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>set_output_delay</code></td>\n<td>数据从 FPGA 出去后到达目标器件的建立时间需求</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{su} + T_{board}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tcl\" data-code=\"# 输入延迟：数据在时钟后 2ns 到达（源同步接口）&#10;set_input_delay -clock sys_clk -max 2.0 [get_ports data_in[*]]&#10;set_input_delay -clock sys_clk -min 0.5 [get_ports data_in[*]]&#10;&#10;# 输出延迟：下游器件需要数据在时钟前 3ns 稳定&#10;set_output_delay -clock sys_clk -max 3.0 [get_ports data_out[*]]&#10;set_output_delay -clock sys_clk -min 0.2 [get_ports data_out[*]]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 输入延迟：数据在时钟后 2ns 到达（源同步接口）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_input_delay -clock sys_clk -max 2.0 [get_ports data_in[*]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_input_delay -clock sys_clk -min 0.5 [get_ports data_in[*]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 输出延迟：下游器件需要数据在时钟前 3ns 稳定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_output_delay -clock sys_clk -max 3.0 [get_ports data_out[*]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_output_delay -clock sys_clk -min 0.2 [get_ports data_out[*]]</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"时序例外\">时序例外</h3><p>时序例外用于处理不遵循单周期约束的特殊路径：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tcl\" data-code=\"# 伪路径：两个时钟域之间用 FIFO 同步，无需检查直接路径&#10;set_false_path -from [get_clocks clk_a] -to [get_clocks clk_b]&#10;&#10;# 静态配置寄存器，仅在初始化时写入&#10;set_false_path -from [get_cells config_reg[*]]&#10;&#10;# 多周期路径：DSP 流水线需要 3 个时钟周期完成&#10;set_multicycle_path 3 -setup \\&#10;    -from [get_cells dsp_stage1/*] \\&#10;    -to [get_cells dsp_stage3/*]&#10;set_multicycle_path 2 -hold \\&#10;    -from [get_cells dsp_stage1/*] \\&#10;    -to [get_cells dsp_stage3/*]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 伪路径：两个时钟域之间用 FIFO 同步，无需检查直接路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_false_path -from [get_clocks clk_a] -to [get_clocks clk_b]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 静态配置寄存器，仅在初始化时写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_false_path -from [get_cells config_reg[*]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 多周期路径：DSP 流水线需要 3 个时钟周期完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_multicycle_path 3 -setup \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -from [get_cells dsp_stage1/*] \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -to [get_cells dsp_stage3/*]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_multicycle_path 2 -hold \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -from [get_cells dsp_stage1/*] \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -to [get_cells dsp_stage3/*]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>例外类型</th>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>set_false_path</code></td>\n<td>CDC 路径、异步复位、静态配置</td>\n<td>工具不检查该路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>set_multicycle_path</code></td>\n<td>慢速数据路径、DSP 流水线</td>\n<td>放宽建立/保持时间窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>set_max_delay</code></td>\n<td>异步路径的最大传播约束</td>\n<td>限制组合延迟上界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>set_clock_groups</code></td>\n<td>不相关时钟域</td>\n<td>两组时钟之间不做时序分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"物理约束\">物理约束</h2><h3 id=\"引脚分配\">引脚分配</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tcl\" data-code=\"# 单端信号引脚分配&#10;set_property PACKAGE_PIN E3 [get_ports clk_100m]&#10;set_property PACKAGE_PIN H5 [get_ports rst_n]&#10;set_property PACKAGE_PIN J5 [get_ports {led[0]}]&#10;set_property PACKAGE_PIN T9 [get_ports {led[1]}]&#10;&#10;# 差分信号&#10;set_property PACKAGE_PIN C4 [get_ports clk_200m_p]&#10;set_property PACKAGE_PIN C3 [get_ports clk_200m_n]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 单端信号引脚分配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_property PACKAGE_PIN E3 [get_ports clk_100m]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_property PACKAGE_PIN H5 [get_ports rst_n]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_property PACKAGE_PIN J5 [get_ports {led[0]}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_property PACKAGE_PIN T9 [get_ports {led[1]}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 差分信号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_property PACKAGE_PIN C4 [get_ports clk_200m_p]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_property PACKAGE_PIN C3 [get_ports clk_200m_n]</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"电气标准\">电气标准</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tcl\" data-code=\"# 通用 IO 标准&#10;set_property IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33 [get_ports {led[*]}]&#10;set_property IOSTANDARD LVCMOS18 [get_ports {data[*]}]&#10;set_property IOSTANDARD LVDS_25  [get_ports clk_200m_p]&#10;&#10;# 驱动强度与斜率&#10;set_property DRIVE 12 [get_ports {data_out[*]}]&#10;set_property SLEW FAST [get_ports {data_out[*]}]&#10;&#10;# 内部上拉&#10;set_property PULLUP TRUE [get_ports rst_n]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 通用 IO 标准</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_property IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33 [get_ports {led[*]}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_property IOSTANDARD LVCMOS18 [get_ports {data[*]}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_property IOSTANDARD LVDS_25  [get_ports clk_200m_p]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 驱动强度与斜率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_property DRIVE 12 [get_ports {data_out[*]}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_property SLEW FAST [get_ports {data_out[*]}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 内部上拉</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_property PULLUP TRUE [get_ports rst_n]</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"io-bank-规划\">IO Bank 规划</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph FPGA引脚规划&#10;        B0[&quot;Bank 0&lt;br/&gt;VCCO=3.3V&lt;br/&gt;LED/Button&lt;br/&gt;LVCMOS33&quot;]&#10;        B1[&quot;Bank 1&lt;br/&gt;VCCO=1.8V&lt;br/&gt;DDR3 数据&lt;br/&gt;SSTL18&quot;]&#10;        B2[&quot;Bank 2&lt;br/&gt;VCCO=2.5V&lt;br/&gt;传感器接口&lt;br/&gt;LVCMOS25&quot;]&#10;        B3[&quot;Bank 3&lt;br/&gt;VCCO=1.2V&lt;br/&gt;高速收发器&lt;br/&gt;LVDS&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph FPGA引脚规划\n        B0[\"Bank 0&lt;br/&gt;VCCO=3.3V&lt;br/&gt;LED/Button&lt;br/&gt;LVCMOS33\"]\n        B1[\"Bank 1&lt;br/&gt;VCCO=1.8V&lt;br/&gt;DDR3 数据&lt;br/&gt;SSTL18\"]\n        B2[\"Bank 2&lt;br/&gt;VCCO=2.5V&lt;br/&gt;传感器接口&lt;br/&gt;LVCMOS25\"]\n        B3[\"Bank 3&lt;br/&gt;VCCO=1.2V&lt;br/&gt;高速收发器&lt;br/&gt;LVDS\"]\n    end</pre><p>同一 Bank 内所有 IO 必须使用相同的 VCCO 电压。不同电压标准的信号必须规划到不同 Bank。</p>\n<h2 id=\"约束文件组织\">约束文件组织</h2><h3 id=\"推荐文件结构\">推荐文件结构</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>加载顺序</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>timing.xdc</code></td>\n<td>时钟定义、输入输出延迟</td>\n<td>综合阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pins.xdc</code></td>\n<td>引脚分配、电气标准</td>\n<td>实现阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>physical.xdc</code></td>\n<td>Pblock、位置约束</td>\n<td>实现阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>debug.xdc</code></td>\n<td>ILA/VIO 调试信号标记</td>\n<td>仅调试构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>false_paths.xdc</code></td>\n<td>时序例外（伪路径、多周期）</td>\n<td>综合阶段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"约束优先级\">约束优先级</h3><p>XDC 约束按文件读入顺序和行号确定优先级：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>后读入的约束覆盖先读入的同类约束</li>\n<li>更具体的约束覆盖通用约束（如针对特定单元的约束优先于通配符）</li>\n<li><code>SCOPED_TO_REF</code> 和 <code>SCOPED_TO_CELLS</code> 可限定约束作用范围</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"常见约束错误与排查\">常见约束错误与排查</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误现象</th>\n<th>可能原因</th>\n<th>排查方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时序报告显示无约束路径</td>\n<td>时钟未定义或名称拼写错误</td>\n<td><code>report_clock_networks</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大量时序违例但设计功能正确</td>\n<td>输入输出延迟过于激进</td>\n<td>核对板级延迟实测数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布线失败（unroutable）</td>\n<td>引脚分配到无法到达的位置</td>\n<td>检查引脚与逻辑的 Bank 对应关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信号完整性问题</td>\n<td>电气标准不匹配或驱动强度不足</td>\n<td>信号完整性仿真（IBIS）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复位释放后随机崩溃</td>\n<td>MMCM LOCKED 未作为复位条件</td>\n<td>添加 MMCM locked 同步逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正确的约束文件是 FPGA 设计质量的重要保障。约束不足会导致时序分析不充分（隐患），约束过度则会过度限制工具优化空间（性能损失）。理想的约束应当&quot;完备但不过度&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>约束文件连接逻辑与物理世界，缺少正确约束时即使 RTL 无误，硬件也可能无法正常工作。</li>\n<li>约束分三类：时序约束（时钟、IO 延迟、多周期、伪路径）影响综合与实现，物理约束决定引脚与电气特性，配置约束影响比特流生成。</li>\n<li>时钟定义（<code>create_clock</code>）是一切时序分析的基础；PLL/MMCM 输出通常自动推断，分频/门控时钟需用 <code>create_generated_clock</code> 手动定义。</li>\n<li>输入输出延迟必须参照板级实测数据，过于激进会制造大量虚假违例。</li>\n<li>时序例外（<code>set_false_path</code>、<code>set_multicycle_path</code>、<code>set_max_delay</code>、<code>set_clock_groups</code>）用于处理不遵循单周期约束的特殊路径。</li>\n<li>引脚分配与电气标准需与 Bank 的 VCCO 电压协调，同 Bank 内 IO 必须使用兼容标准。</li>\n<li>XDC 按读入顺序与行号确定优先级，推荐按 timing/pins/physical/debug/false_paths 分文件组织。</li>\n<li>常见错误包括时钟未定义、IO 延迟不当、引脚超范围、电气标准不匹配和 MMCM LOCKED 未纳入复位。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"约束文件编写","id":"约束文件编写"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"约束文件的作用与分类","id":"约束文件的作用与分类"},{"level":2,"text":"时序约束","id":"时序约束"},{"level":3,"text":"时钟定义（create_clock）","id":"时钟定义-create_clock"},{"level":3,"text":"生成时钟（create_generated_clock）","id":"生成时钟-create_generated_clock"},{"level":3,"text":"输入/输出延迟","id":"输入-输出延迟"},{"level":3,"text":"时序例外","id":"时序例外"},{"level":2,"text":"物理约束","id":"物理约束"},{"level":3,"text":"引脚分配","id":"引脚分配"},{"level":3,"text":"电气标准","id":"电气标准"},{"level":3,"text":"IO Bank 规划","id":"io-bank-规划"},{"level":2,"text":"约束文件组织","id":"约束文件组织"},{"level":3,"text":"推荐文件结构","id":"推荐文件结构"},{"level":3,"text":"约束优先级","id":"约束优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"常见约束错误与排查","id":"常见约束错误与排查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"综合与实现流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-development-flow/synthesis-implementation"},"next":{"title":"仿真与时序分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-development-flow/simulation-timing-analysis"}}